# Scheming Silvertongue: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if you gained 2 or more life this turn, this creature becomes prepared." Attacking
# with it (flying, lifelink) and the Postmortem Professor (its trigger gains 1) gains Bot1 1 life twice, 2 in all, so at the second main phase it is prepared.
# Sign in Blood ({B}{B}, cast from exile) targets Bot1: it draws two cards and loses 2 life, and the Silvertongue is unprepared.

